flowchart TD
  Manager[Active authorized PSE manager]
  Annual[Create draft annual target and currency]
  Quarters[Store Q1 to Q4 baselines with uneven amounts allowed]
  Grid[Allocate each quarter by employee and vertical]
  Request[Request approve_target_plan]
  Identity{Authorized manager?}
  Lock[Lock parent target plan row]
  Draft{Plan is draft?}
  AnnualCheck{Exactly four quarters sum to annual amount?}
  GridCheck{Each quarter grid sums to its baseline and employees are valid?}
  Reject[Reject transaction and preserve draft]
  Approve[Record approved status actor and timestamp]
  Fixed[Block plan quarter and allocation changes]
  Actuals[Record realized contributions separately]
  Report[Compare actuals with fixed targets by currency and period]
  Manager --> Annual --> Quarters --> Grid --> Request --> Identity
  Identity -- No --> Reject
  Identity -- Yes --> Lock --> Draft
  Draft -- No --> Reject
  Draft -- Yes --> AnnualCheck
  AnnualCheck -- No --> Reject
  AnnualCheck -- Yes --> GridCheck
  GridCheck -- No --> Reject
  GridCheck -- Yes --> Approve --> Fixed --> Report
  Actuals --> Report
  Report --> Unchanged[Q1 overachievement leaves Q2 baseline unchanged]
  Grid -. edits take the same parent lock .-> Lock
